ument_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1660112006:1":{"text":"それから、石のレンガやトタンも、全部却下！アヴァロンの建築スタイルと全然合わないよ！","source_cn":"呃，还有石砖、铁皮之类的……都不行！这一点都不符合阿瓦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC652BD1E5B34F7D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1660112007:1":{"text":"僕なら、装飾品は全部自然のものを使うね。木目や花びらの模様を生かしたデザインが一番だよ！","source_cn":"要我说的话，最好的装饰都都来源于大自然。木头的纹理，花...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x062DC50368002B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1660112008:1":{"text":"よほっ、それはヴェルディアの伝統だろう。それも春鮮市場には合わないと思うがなぁ。","source_cn":"嚯，你这是典型的绿裔风格，和春鲜集市也不搭配！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECD633317380FB36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1660112009:1":{"text":"そんなに植物がいいなら、機械やレンガに似たような模様を刻めばいいじゃないか。そうすれば、アンタの希望も叶うし、建物も頑丈になる。一石二鳥だろ？","source_cn":"达米安老师，你要是实在喜欢树木花草的话，我们其实可以在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15810FA9A06F38A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1660112010:1":{"text":"でも、石とか鉄の質感は変わらないだろ？そんなのを使ったら、市場じゃなくて兵舎になっちゃうよ！","source_cn":"但是石头和铁皮的质感很难改变，这只会让集市看起来像一个兵营！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F6BCB46327ABF97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","vari